| `PrimaryButton` | wide bottom CTA, height 60, radius 30; variants `glass` (default) and `solid` |
| `PillButton` | small in-card pill, height 44, chevron on its left, placed at the card's visual left |
| `SegmentedTabs` | 2 options, sizes `md` (40) / `lg` (48); active = solid `teal` + white text + `shadow.active` |
| `ProgressPill` | glass capsule with counter text on the left and a gradient bar |
| `ProgressRing` | SVG ring, 84pt, stroke 7 |
| `DayChip` | 52×84 vertical chip "יום א׳ / עלייה" |
| `CheckRow` | check circle (right), label, radio dot (left) |
